  "semantic_correspondence": [
    "Original SQL preserved; new exact compile/dialect/IR041 and backend version govern row-count HAVING; old040 two complete response bytes retained unchanged",
    "Projected count with nonempty required String grouping, original literal and exact slot; unsupported alias/group/projection/version and candidate cases refuse without SQL",
    "Many-to-many finite bag oracle preserves repeated occurrences; compiler joined WHERE guard retains full joined bag and excludes HAVING/ORDER/LIMIT",
